id: etsy-search
section: Sites
item: Etsy's search renders its styled listing cards (T-498); DataDome may ask for a verification on a first visit
shells: enyo mochi mojo
page: https://www.etsy.com/search?q=webos
kit: cavekit-modern-web.md R2
needs: internet
wait rect 'sel:body' 60
wait url etsy.com 60
expect url etsy.com
wait content 0,100,768,900 45
expect content 0,100,768,900 'sel:body'
